-- Layer: our usage: a load list (lib/core.cub loads the library after the core) (the four layers: see the language-implementation-remainder node of task-graph/hyperactivity.cub).
-- lib/library.cub — the library, in load order: the core and every file that checks after it with
-- no further prerequisite. `make library` checks it; a file written to load after the library
-- imports this one.
